{
  "about": "The preferences a device keeps with the account (spec/sync-protocol.md, Preferences): a key each, its value the part of the device's settings it names. defaults is what each key holds on a device where nothing was set yet, every key the account keeps. Each of roundTrips is one value of its key a device takes from the account and then holds for that key again, the other keys left as they were. Each of unreadable is a value a device cannot take, or a key it has none of, which leaves a device holding the values of roundTrips as it was.",
